        <head>CRICKET.</head>
        <p>CRICKET.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON V. ASHTON-UNDER-LYNE.—This match,• the Warrington team's last engagement of the season was played at Ashton on Saturday. Score : WARRINGTON. ASHTON. P. B. Hawtin b Hewet- G. R. Cliffe Connor ... son E. A. Connor run out 0 b Lynes ll W. H. Podmore b Bailey 3 F.LEatonlbwb Lynes 4 Lynes lbw b Bailey J. W. Bibby b Bailey 7 H. Coop not out 0 B. Silcock b Hewetson... 19 J. A. Briggs b Bailey ... 3 J. Thompson st Watson b</p>
