        <p>SOMETHING " EXTRA 'NICE."</p>
        <p>Natural Fruit Jellies.</p>
        <p>b_l:or a cooling refreshing summer diet nothing can be etter or moreenjoyable than natural Fruit Jellies, pre- ttied with the juice of any fresh fruit and Brown and " Patent" Corn Flour. They are not only tz•••cra nice" but "extra good," and much to be pre- ,Ltred to artificially flavoured prepared jellies, which -"3„ of little food value. #2srovvn and Poison's natural Fruit Jellies are cooling the blood, delicious to the palate, and are food as well as refreshment. • You. will find a variety of attractive recipes for such Vies and other light summer diet in Brown and a:lson's new booklet," Summer Dishes," which will be °flit 4Brown and Poison, Dept. RlO, Paisley, on receipt IlyPenny stamp.</p>
